          <bibl xml:id="source-D.CEL-0428-369"><idno>D.CEL-0428-369</idno>: <title>Celestine I, letter to the bishops
              of Vienne and Narbonne, 428</title>, ed. <editor>Pierre Coustant</editor>, <title>Epistolae Romanorum
