              Dacheriana</title> in Bern, Burgerbibliothek, 425: the file's description of the manuscript.</bibl>
          <bibl xml:id="source-COLL.His.ms-Vat-BAV-Pal575"><idno>COLL.His.ms-Vat-BAV-Pal575</idno>: <title>Collectio
